WEBVTT

00:16:27.246 --> 00:16:31.412
we must aggressively reclaim
the enormous promise

00:16:31.454 --> 00:16:34.579
of the great American experiment,

00:16:34.621 --> 00:16:38.537
of our American politics,

00:16:38.579 --> 00:16:41.037
our politics.

00:16:41.079 --> 00:16:45.162
Not red politics. Not blue politics, ours.

00:16:46.121 --> 00:16:47.371
Thank you.